@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000
@token = replace-with-bearer-token
@customerOrderId = 123
@callOffId = 456

### Find the available stock groups for a customer order
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/calloff/delivery-candidates?customerOrderId={{customerOrderId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Add a planned delivery to an existing active call-off
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/calloff/{{callOffId}}/planned-deliveries
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerOrderId": {{customerOrderId}},
  "editionPerPallet": 1000,
  "nrOfItems": 2000,
  "nrOfPallets": 2,
  "isDelivered": false
}

### Preview transport legs for unsaved call-off deliveries (calls Google with the company API key)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/calloff/route-preview
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerDeliveryAddressId": null,
  "deliveries": [
    { "deliveryFromStockId": 789 },
    { "newDelivery": { "customerOrderId": {{customerOrderId}}, "editionPerPallet": 1000 } }
  ]
}

### Recalculate and store the transport legs of a saved call-off
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/calloff/{{callOffId}}/route/recalculate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Recalculate a call-off that does not exist (404)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/calloff/0/route/recalculate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
